  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>這是我第二張空島地圖。這張地圖與眾不同，不再是無聊的傳統空島，你會在蒼白花園中誕生。你必須設法使用蒼白木材奮力求生，還要與&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">嘎吱作響者<span style=\"color:#fff\">對抗。歡迎在留言區展示你的建築作品！</span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0b1afb95-b0fe-4b39-899e-2daa267dfd48.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"824\" height=\"718\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">祝玩得開心 :)</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>也來看看我的其他地圖吧！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/forest-and-fields-adventure-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">森林與田野</a></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/seven-survival-islands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">七座生存島嶼</a></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/the-mysterious-island\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘島嶼</a></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>J.M.J.</strong></span></p>",
